  "prefLabel": "Fors 403.06 Exemption",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 403.06 Exemption. A licensee shall be exempt from the continuing education requirements for serving on temporary active duty in the armed forces of the United States for a period of time exceeding 120 consecutive days in a year.\n\nSource. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10087, eff 3-1-12; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14086, eff 11-24-24",
